    "press_slider_RjQEQM": {
      "type": "press-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_VETTYK": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "img_slide": "shopify://shop_images/Media_Outlet_Logos_Website-02.png",
            "text_slide": "<p>“For months now, I’ve lived joyfully knowing that any time I want to bring my tea or coffee with me, the taste will remain pure. In fact, I’m sipping a perfectly balanced tea from my Nomad Flip as I write this.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_gg7rW8": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "img_slide": "shopify://shop_images/Media_Outlet_Logos_Website-01.png",
            "text_slide": "<p>\"I recently invested in a Created Co. Nomad to-go mug for my coffee and it was the best money I’ve ever spent. Not only is it sleek and stylish, but it also keeps my coffee hot for hours on end, and doesn’t change the flavor thanks to a nifty ceramic interior like other travel mugs tend to do.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_aGyE6y": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "img_slide": "shopify://shop_images/Media_Outlet_Logos_Website-05.png",
            "text_slide": "<p>“Created Co. has just released a new stainless steel, double-walled water bottle perfect for both once-in-a-lifetime adventures and everyday use. It's durable, slim, and expertly designed.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_t6jcVb": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "img_slide": "shopify://shop_images/Media_Outlet_Logos_Website-03.png",
            "text_slide": "<p>On Angle Drip Mug: \"This update on the traditional diner version lets you wrap three fingers around it, resting them on the flat inner edge so you can navigate through sipping without wobbles or slippage.\"</p>"
          }
        },
        "slide_84g3hy": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "img_slide": "shopify://shop_images/Media_Outlet_Logos_Website-06.png",
            "text_slide": "<p>\"Created Co. hires California artists to create these gorgeous stainless steel Cold Cups, and we can see all the thought they put into the details; the ceramic coating, elegant thinner handle, and the solid colorway from top to bottom.\"</p>"
          }
        }
      },
